cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Regeneration Lab in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Regeneration Lab: an in-silico research lab for limb regeneration"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Ghani
    given-names: Aadil
repository-code: "https://github.com/aadilghani1/regen-lab"
url: "https://aadilghani1.github.io/regen-lab/"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  An open, computer-only research lab that models salamander limb regeneration
  with a functional TypeScript agent-based model, an evidence registry linking
  every model rule to its sources, tracked reproducible runs and an interactive
  browser viewer.
keywords:
  - regeneration
  - axolotl
  - blastema
  - computational biology
  - agent-based model
